      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/15/prince-harry-ukraine-war-surprise-trip-invictus-games",
      "description": "<p>Duke of Sussex meets wounded veterans in city and says country could one day host Invictus Games</p><p>Prince Harry has told Ukrainian soldiers they are going to win the war with Russia, during a surprise visit to the country.</p><p>The Duke of Sussex met wounded veterans and medics in the city of Lviv, in the west of Ukraine, as he addressed a conference on treating those injured in war. He said he had taken a risk in travelling to the country, but that he had felt “warmth” when arriving on Saturday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/15/prince-harry-ukraine-war-surprise-trip-invictus-games\">Continue reading...</a>",
